// Reference screenshots checked by the `visual-tester` agent, in the `ultra` and `ds` presets.
// Fields mirror the command line: `strata --screenshot screenshots/<name>-<preset>.png ...`
// Without `pos`, the camera starts at the spawn point of the seed. Without `seed`, the
// diorama `scene` (`assets/scenes/<scene>.ron`, `preview` by default) is captured.
// `time` is the world time in ticks (`--time`; noon if omitted, 24000 a day).
// `break` (`--break x,y,z`) breaks a block just before the capture; `particles`
// (`--particles <seconds>`) simulates particles that long first. `world_code`
// (`--world-code`) generates the world with these settings (world types).
